    "answer": {
      "short": "980; the LCM of 4 and 5 is 20, and 980 is its largest three-digit multiple.",
      "worked": "The LCM of 4 and 5 is 20, so a number divisible by both must be a multiple of 20.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}20\\times49&=980\\\\20\\times50&=1000\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore, the largest three-digit number divisible by both 4 and 5 is 980.",
